| TV/JSD | 两报告距离 | 稳定/扰动分析 | canonical mapping | 小距离=正确 |
| Brier | resolved proper loss | outcome | authorized resolution | 单样本=calibration |
| ECE | 分箱校准误差 | secondary calibration | 足量同域 claims | 不报 bins/coverage |
| lineage count | 合格来源记录数 | provenance 描述 | source validation | 0=没有来源/独立 |
| exposure | prompt 实际交付 event | 架构遥测 | runtime audit | 等同注意/采纳/因果 |
| consensus/Gini | 群体派生描述 | mediator/secondary | 独立预测验证 | 等同质量/公平 |

